"""Core relational schema (tables, constraints, indexes). No security policies yet.

Design rules enforced here:
* UUID primary keys generated by the database (gen_random_uuid()).
* Every tenant-owned table carries organization_id NOT NULL.
* Composite foreign keys (organization_id, X) make cross-tenant references
  impossible at the integrity layer, independently of RLS.
* Secure defaults: new tasks/documents are 'private'; new users are 'pending'.
* Secrets (password hashes, token hashes) live in dedicated tables/columns
  so they can be locked down with grants separately from profile data.

Revision ID: 0001_core_schema
Revises:
Create Date: 2026-11-17
"""

